# CSS Guide (Short)

- Header:  
  ```css
  /* =============================================================================
   * NOBLE ARCHITECTURE - [STYLESHEET NAME]
   * =============================================================================
   */
  ```
- Regions:  
  Use regions for organization; follow JS 60-char divider.

- Align all property colons at ~column 40.

- Indent 4 spaces in regions.

- **Variables:**  
  Use CSS vars—`--App_Category_Name`—for colors, spacing, reused values.

- **Naming:**  
  BEM:  
    - `.block`  
    - `.block__element`  
    - `.block--modifier`

- **Fonts:**  
  Don't use `@font-face`.  
  Fonts loaded with `Loader__AppAssetsLoader__.js` (get `'Open Sans'` 300–700).  
  ```css
  body { font-family: 'Open Sans', ...; font-weight: 400; }
  ```

- Include inline comments for unclear props.

**ALWAYS:**  
- File header  
- Regions  
- Column-alignment  
- CSS vars  
- BEM

**NEVER:**  
- Omit header  
- Hardcode colors/spacing  
- Use tabs  
- Skip alignment
